{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Ayrton Idle</u></strong> is an <strong><u>Auto-Battler Idler RPG</u></strong> \u2014 a game by Ayrton, for Ayrton... and now, for you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired</strong> by the golden age of <strong>Flash</strong> games, <strong><u>Ayrton Idle</u></strong> is built to run in the <strong>background</strong> or <strong>alongside</strong> your daily <strong>tasks</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted the Mobile Idle experience but without the MTX, so I originally made this game to entertain myself while I worked.\u2014 now it\u2019s here to keep you busy while you\u2019re busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Battles</strong> \u2013 combat plays out while you focus elsewhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> \u2013 tackle preset sequences of fights for rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caves</strong> \u2013 procedurally generated tile-based maps with battles and hidden chests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Equipment Slots</strong> \u2013 Head, Body, Hand, Legs, Main Hand, Off Hand, Ring, Neck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Gear</strong> \u2013 boost your item's stats over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining</strong> &amp; <strong>Smelting</strong> \u2013 gather and refine resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing</strong> \u2013 relax and catch something valuable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest System</strong> \u2013 complete tasks and earn progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a <strong>simple</strong>, satisfying idle experience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re in the right place.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 